    "title": "Longtime Birnam Wood Bartender Was Victim in Fatal Montecito Traffic Collision - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evelyn Spence, South County Editor ,\n10 hours ago The pedestrian who died after being struck by a car on Coast Village Road Sunday evening was identified by Birnam Wood Golf Club as Pedro Rivera, a longtime club bartender. Rivera was also the assistant general manager at Teddy’s By the Sea in Carpinteria, owner Sarah Dandona confirmed in a GoFundMe post. Read full article",
